基づき作成したものであり、実際の業績は今後様々な要因により予想数値とは異なる結果となる可能性があります。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "（―年―月―日発表）", null, "CurrentYearInstant_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ResultMember"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2027-03-31", null, "CurrentYearInstant"]]}}